{"book":13,"chapter":24,"rubric":"PYTHON AS A FIRST LANGUAGE / ITERATORS AND GENERATORS / CHAPTER 24","slides":[{"title":"Coroutine","sub":"A generator that receives and yields","short":"Coroutine","main":"A pausable function with two-way exchange is a coroutine.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Supplier","Two-way exchange","Coroutine"],"captions":["Before, a generator only yielded values: next, and you get one","Now it also receives values, errors and a close signal","A pausable function with two-way exchange is a coroutine; async programs grew out of it"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"g","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"generator","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"caller","tone":"muted","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":204.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":140.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"g","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"generator","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"caller","tone":"muted","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":204.0,"y1":58.0,"x2":140.0,"y2":58.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":140.0,"y1":82.0,"x2":204.0,"y2":82.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":118.0,"text":"send · throw · close","tone":"yellow","size":10.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":110.0,"h":30.0,"text":"coroutine","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":260.0,"y":70.0,"w":110.0,"h":30.0,"text":"async / await","tone":"yellow","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":146.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":204.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6}]],"cues":[11.3,26.9]}]},{"title":"Life cycle","sub":"Four states","short":"States","main":"The first request is always next.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Four states","First request","Early send"],"captions":["Created → running → paused at yield → closed; see inspect.getgeneratorstate","First request is a plain next: the body runs to the first yield","send(5) to a fresh generator is a TypeError: nothing can receive yet"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":56.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"CREATED","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":150.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"RUNNING","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":240.0,"y":40.0,"w":90.0,"h":26.0,"text":"SUSPENDED","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"d","x":320.0,"y":100.0,"w":70.0,"h":26.0,"text":"CLOSED","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":96.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":110.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":190.0,"y1":62.0,"x2":200.0,"y2":50.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e3","x1":280.0,"y1":52.0,"x2":308.0,"y2":90.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":24.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["def gen():","    print('start')","    yield 1","g = gen()      # CREATED","next(g)        # start, SUSPENDED"],"hl":[1,2,4],"lang":"python","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":310.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":30.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["g = gen()","g.send(5)","# TypeError: can't send non-None","# value to a just-started generator"],"bad":[1,2,3],"lang":"python","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":310.0}]],"cues":[10.9,23.3]}]},{"title":"send","sub":"yield as an expression","short":"send","main":"send puts a value into yield and returns the next one.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["yield as an expression","send(10)","send(20)","Average"],"captions":["yield has a value: x = yield is what send delivered","send(10): wakes up, x = 10, computes the average, pauses at yield","send(20): same code, total and count kept in local variables","send returns what the next yield gave: the current average"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":24.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["def averager():","    total = count = 0","    avg = None","    while True:","        x = yield avg","        total += x","        count += 1","        avg = total / count"],"hl":[4],"lang":"python","size":10.0,"lh":17.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":24.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["def averager():","    total = count = 0","    avg = None","    while True:","        x = yield avg","        total += x","        count += 1","        avg = total / count"],"hl":[5,6,7],"lang":"python","size":10.0,"lh":17.0,"w":320.0},{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":300.0,"y":50.0,"w":80.0,"h":34.0,"text":"total=10\ncount=1","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":24.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["def averager():","    total = count = 0","    avg = None","    while True:","        x = yield avg","        total += x","        count += 1","        avg = total / count"],"hl":[5,6,7],"lang":"python","size":10.0,"lh":17.0,"w":320.0},{"t":"cell","id":"s","x":300.0,"y":50.0,"w":80.0,"h":34.0,"text":"total=30\ncount=2","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["avg = averager()","next(avg)","avg.send(10)    # 10.0","avg.send(20)    # 15.0","avg.send(30)    # 20.0"],"hl":[2,3,4],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":22.0,"w":300.0}]],"cues":[5.9,21.0,29.9]}]},{"title":"Priming a coroutine","sub":"First next","short":"Priming","main":"Forgot next, and the first send fails.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Forgot next","Decorator","send(None)"],"captions":["A coroutine must be primed: the first next runs it to yield; forget it and the first send fails","A small decorator creates the generator and makes the first request","send(None) is the same as next, and primes just as well"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":40.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["avg = averager()","avg.send(10)   # TypeError!"],"bad":[1],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":26.0,"w":280.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":24.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["def primed(func):","    def wrapper(*args):","        gen = func(*args)","        next(gen)","        return gen","    return wrapper"],"hl":[2,3],"lang":"python","size":10.5,"lh":20.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":40.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["g = averager()","g.send(None)   # = next(g)","g.send(10)     # 10.0"],"hl":[1],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":24.0,"w":280.0}]],"cues":[12.9,26.9]}]},{"title":"throw","sub":"Throw an exception","short":"throw","main":"You can catch the error at yield and carry on.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Throw an error","Catch","Not caught"],"captions":["gen.throw(ValueError) raises it at the pause point, as if yield were a raise","The generator caught it and went on: throw returns the next yielded value","Not caught: the exception flies out to the caller"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"caller","tone":"muted","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"g","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":110.0,"h":30.0,"text":"yield ← raise","tone":"red","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":124.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":212.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"red","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":112.0,"text":"gen.throw(ValueError)","tone":"red","size":10.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":24.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["def counter():","    n = 0","    while True:","        try:","            yield n","            n += 1","        except ValueError:","            n = 0   # reset"],"hl":[6,7],"lang":"python","size":10.0,"lh":17.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":30.0,"y":56.0,"lines":["def gen():","    yield 1","g = gen(); next(g)","g.throw(KeyError)","# KeyError flew out"],"hl":[3,4],"bad":[4],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":22.0,"w":300.0}]],"cues":[18.3,29.0]}]},{"title":"close","sub":"GeneratorExit","short":"close","main":"Put cleanup in finally.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["close()","finally","Do not yield"],"captions":["close() throws a special GeneratorExit at the pause point; do not catch it","The stack unwinds and finally blocks run: close files and connections here","Yielding after close is a RuntimeError; the GC calls close itself, but do not rely on it"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":70.0,"y":70.0,"w":100.0,"h":30.0,"text":"g.close()","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"g","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":30.0,"text":"GeneratorExit at yield","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":124.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":192.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":24.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["def reader(path):","    f = open(path)","    try:","        for line in f:","            yield line","    finally:","        f.close()   # will run"],"hl":[5,6],"lang":"python","size":10.0,"lh":18.0,"w":310.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":24.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["try:","    yield 1","except GeneratorExit:","    yield 2    # RuntimeError","# generator ignored GeneratorExit"],"bad":[3,4],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":22.0,"w":310.0}]],"cues":[15.0,26.8]}]},{"title":"return in a generator","sub":"StopIteration.value","short":"return","main":"The result sits in the exception's value attribute.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["return value","StopIteration.value","for stays silent"],"captions":["A generator may end with return and a value: a total, a count","The value is in the value attribute of StopIteration","for drops it; next and send can catch it; yield from is the main consumer"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["def summing(items):","    total = 0","    for x in items:","        total += x","        yield x","    return total"],"hl":[5],"lang":"python","size":10.5,"lh":20.0,"w":300.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["g = summing([1, 2, 3])","next(g); next(g); next(g)","next(g)","# StopIteration: 6"],"hl":[3],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":24.0,"w":300.0},{"t":"cell","id":"v","x":300.0,"y":130.0,"w":80.0,"h":26.0,"text":"value = 6","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["for x in summing([1, 2, 3]):","    print(x)     # 1 2 3","# 6 discarded"],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":24.0,"w":300.0}]],"cues":[13.1,21.3]}]},{"title":"yield from","sub":"Transparent delegation","short":"yield from","main":"The nested result is the expression's value.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Delegation","Transparent channel","Result"],"captions":["yield from inner() hands work to the nested generator: its values go out","send and throw pass inside, close reaches the nested one: the outer is transparent","The nested return value becomes the value of yield from"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"o","x":60.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"caller","tone":"muted","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"m","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"outer","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"i","x":300.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"inner","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":258.0,"y1":82.0,"x2":224.0,"y2":82.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":138.0,"y1":82.0,"x2":104.0,"y2":82.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"o","x":60.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"caller","tone":"muted","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"m","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"outer","tone":"blue","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"i","x":300.0,"y":70.0,"w":80.0,"h":30.0,"text":"inner","tone":"green","size":11.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":104.0,"y1":62.0,"x2":138.0,"y2":62.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":224.0,"y1":62.0,"x2":258.0,"y2":62.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":124.0,"text":"send / throw / close pass through","tone":"yellow","size":10.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":30.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["def outer():","    total = yield from summing([1, 2])","    print('result', total)   # 3"],"hl":[1],"lang":"python","size":11.0,"lh":24.0,"w":310.0}]],"cues":[19.4,26.6]}]},{"title":"Recursive traversal","sub":"Nested lists","short":"Traversal","main":"Treat strings as leaves.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Nested lists","Recursion","Strings are leaves"],"captions":["Flatten [1, [2, [3, 4]], 5] of any depth into a flat sequence","A list item: delegate to self with yield from; otherwise yield the item","Strings are leaves: else endless recursion, a string is made of strings"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":30.0,"w":160.0,"h":24.0,"text":"[1, [2, [3, 4]], 5]","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":120.0,"y":74.0,"w":60.0,"h":22.0,"text":"[2, [3, 4]]","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":190.0,"y":116.0,"w":50.0,"h":22.0,"text":"[3, 4]","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":160.0,"y1":42.0,"x2":130.0,"y2":62.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":120.0,"y1":86.0,"x2":170.0,"y2":106.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":20.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["def flatten(items):","    for x in items:","        if isinstance(x, list):","            yield from flatten(x)","        else:","            yield x"],"hl":[3,5],"lang":"python","size":10.5,"lh":20.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":20.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["if isinstance(x, (list, tuple)):","    yield from flatten(x)","else:","    yield x   # 'ab' is a leaf"],"hl":[0,3],"lang":"python","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[16.1,22.8]}]},{"title":"Coroutine pipeline","sub":"Pushing data","short":"Pipeline","main":"Each stage is a generator with an endless loop.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Pushing","Filter","Closing"],"captions":["The source sends values to the first stage; data is pushed, not pulled","Each stage is an endless-loop generator: receive, process, pass on","Close the chain from the source so the finally blocks run in order"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":56.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"source","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"filter","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":304.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"sink","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e1","x1":96.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":140.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"line","id":"e2","x1":220.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":262.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":116.0,"text":"send →","tone":"yellow","size":10.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c~code","x":24.0,"y":44.0,"lines":["def keep(pred, target):","    while True:","        item = yield","        if pred(item):","            target.send(item)"],"hl":[2,3,4],"lang":"python","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":310.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":56.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"source","tone":"red","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"filter","tone":"muted","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":304.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"sink","tone":"muted","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"text","id":"n","x":180.0,"y":118.0,"text":"close() in order, left to right","tone":"yellow","size":10.0}]],"cues":[17.2,25.7]}]},{"title":"Scheduler","sub":"Cooperative multitasking","short":"Scheduler","main":"Switching only at yield.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Task queue","Step and yield control","To the back of the queue"],"captions":["Several generator tasks wait in a queue; the scheduler takes the first","It asks for one step: yield means ready to give up control","Unfinished goes to the back; done (StopIteration) is removed; switching only at yield"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"t0","x":80.0,"y":56.0,"w":56.0,"h":30.0,"text":"A","tone":"blue","size":12